{"kind":"table","sheet":"Prioritas","address":"A1:G14","rows":14,"cols":7,"values":[["HOTS original | Handover 14 Okt 2026",null,null,null,null,null,null],["Audit source / mock; implementasi oleh project Kantor. Belum diuji produksi.",null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["ID","Prioritas","Temuan","Bukti / status","Tindakan","Acceptance","Sumber Kantor"],["R01","P0","table-engine Escape saves cancelled edits","Bug reproduced; fixed only in Cineva fork","Use a ref to suppress the following blur save; add keyboard cancel regression coverage","Escape: 0 save callback/request dan nilai kembali; Enter/blur menyimpan tepat sekali; rejection mengembalikan nilai lama.","packages/table-engine/src/cells/EditableCell.tsx"],["R02","P1","Builder allowed field types not enforced in inspector","Observed; Cineva registry guard","Pass allowed types into inspector or filter the registry consistently for both creation and edit","Create dan inspector memakai whitelist yang sama; field lama di luar whitelist tetap round-trip tanpa kehilangan metadata.","dynamic-form/src/UnifiedFormStructureBuilder.tsx"],["R03","P1","Trigger client query/types differ from backend","Source verified; Cineva adapter","Correct public filter/category types and keep legacy aliases additive","function_type, category, search, is_active dikirim sesuai backend; categories bertipe {category,count}[]; alias type lama tetap didukung dengan aturan precedence.","packages/engine-client/src/hots/trigger.ts; Integrated-API/programs/hots/core/settings/controllers/triggerFunctionController.js"],["R04","P1","UI package optional peers and entry points","Integration gap observed","Provide documented component subpaths and peer resolution/hoisting recipe; Cineva adds subpaths and host Vite dedupe","Clean install/build fixture dua host berhasil; import komponen dasar tidak membutuhkan peer opsional yang tidak dipakai; React singleton; Tailwind preset dapat di-resolve.","packages/ui-kit/package.json; src/index.ts; tailwind-preset.cjs"],["R05","P2","Package docs/version/status drift","Observed","Generate or verify registry/version/status from package.json and actual imports","Versi README cocok package.json; adoption di registry dapat ditelusuri ke import/call site; CHANGELOG dan compatibility ikut diperbarui.","packages/app-core/docs/README.md; engine-client/docs/README.md; 3.Knowledge/packages/REGISTRY.md"],["R06","P1","Shared engine-client surface incomplete","Documented by reference","Define typed clients from actual backend routes/envelopes, with additive compatibility wrappers","Client diuji terhadap route/envelope nyata; error success:false ditolak; auth/base URL di-inject; EAV dan pagination tetap kompatibel.","packages/engine-client/docs/README.md"],["R07","P1","Builder domain extension gaps","Observed","Add optional inspector hooks/registries without importing app store or API into packages","Hook opsional default perilaku lama; JSON metadata tak dikenal round-trip; row group/widget inspector berfungsi tanpa import store/API aplikasi.","dynamic-form/src/UnifiedFormStructureBuilder.tsx"],["R08","P0","Auth documentation contradicts current implementation","Previously audited; rechecked source","Reconcile code, provider/backend contracts and docs in the Office project; do not blindly switch consumers","Audit login/refresh/logout/SSO/MFE/SSE dan CORS/CSRF selesai; dokumen mencerminkan implementasi; migrasi auth hanya setelah consumer/backend kompatibel.","HOTS/src/lib/authToken.ts; app-core/src/http.ts"],["R09","P1","HOTS reference itself only partly adopts packages","Reference metadata/source inventory","Plan gradual migration with compatibility wrappers; package presence is not runtime adoption","Migrasi satu consumer per tahap; tindakan/role/pagination/filter/export dan submit diuji; kode lama diarsipkan setelah pengganti terbukti.","HOTS/package.json; HOTS/src/components/ui; packages/REGISTRY.md"],["R10","P2","page-engine and app-template readiness","Registry documented","Complete package surface before claiming full page/shell/commerce reuse","Status helper/candidate dinyatakan akurat; renderer baru hanya setelah requirements, kontrak dan minimal dua consumer jelas.","packages/page-engine; 3.Knowledge/packages/REGISTRY.md"]]}
